## Dotfiles Management

Using **yadm** to manage dotfiles across home and work laptops.

- Repository: `git@github.com:fraserYT/dotfiles.git`
- This machine's class: `home`
- Work laptop class: `work`
- Machine-specific files use `##class.home` / `##class.work` suffix

Currently tracking: Hyprland configs (`.config/hypr/`), `.ssh/config`, `.zshrc`, this file.

⚠️ **`~/CLAUDE.md` is a generated yadm alternate — never edit it directly.** yadm tracks
`CLAUDE.md##class.home` / `##class.work` and regenerates `~/CLAUDE.md` from the matching one
automatically after `add`/`commit`/`checkout`. Edits made to the generated file are destroyed the
next time any yadm command runs. **Edit `CLAUDE.md##class.home`, then `yadm alt`.** This bit once:
the 2026-09-08 simstim rename was written to the generated file and silently lost on 2026-09-13.

